{
    "title": "Soundmap - Find Your Songs",
    "description": "Soundmap is for REAL MUSIC FANS! Find songs, trade songs, complete artists quests, build your ultimate collection, and show how much you love MUSIC!\r\n\r\nMap Drops: Walk around with the app open to collect songs from nearby drops. Each song can be common, uncommon, rare, shiny, or epic. Get those drops before they are claimed by someone else!\r\nTrade: Have a song you want? See if anyone is trading them on the market. Put up your best offer and negotiate!\r\nQuests: Love an artists? Complete their artists quests to collect all their discography!\r\n\r\nSoundmap is a location-based app where you explore the world and find music. Users have to opt in to share location either always or while using the app. Both permission requests will be presented during onboarding. By signing up, you agree to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. We collect location data to enable app usage even when the app is closed or not in use.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.notion.so/intonation/Music-Map-Terms-of-Service-06a68afb2654438090bea89dbf02ba08?pvs=4\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.notion.so/intonation/Music-Map-Privacy-Policy-6755e1c43ee74fe0b4060d2176a6ba0d?pvs=4",
    "descriptionHTML": "Soundmap is for REAL MUSIC FANS! Find songs, trade songs, complete artists quests, build your ultimate collection, and show how much you love MUSIC!<br><br>Map Drops: Walk around with the app open to collect songs from nearby drops. Each song can be common, uncommon, rare, shiny, or epic. Get those drops before they are claimed by someone else!<br>Trade: Have a song you want? See if anyone is trading them on the market. Put up your best offer and negotiate!<br>Quests: Love an artists? Complete their artists quests to collect all their discography!<br><br>Soundmap is a location-based app where you explore the world and find music. Users have to opt in to share location either always or while using the app. Both permission requests will be presented during onboarding. By signing up, you agree to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. We collect location data to enable app usage even when the app is closed or not in use.<br><br>Terms of Service: https://www.notion.so/intonation/Music-Map-Terms-of-Service-06a68afb2654438090bea89dbf02ba08?pvs=4<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.notion.so/intonation/Music-Map-Privacy-Policy-6755e1c43ee74fe0b4060d2176a6ba0d?pvs=4",
